ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi086: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP 'collapsed_line_edge'; exactly ONE VERTEX_POINT at (0,0,0); EDGE_CURVE: edge_start = edge_end = same VERTEX_POINT; edge_geometry is a LINE from (0,0,0) along (1,0,0) — non-degenerate by type; both boundary parameters declared as 0.0 => zero length interval; BRepLib_MakeEdge LineThroughIdenticPoints triggered; collapsed_line_edge defect tag; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; EDGE_CURVE IS wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned; entity refs in EDGE_CURVE: #11,#11,#22 (start=end=vertex, geom=line) */
